   <section className="public-bottom-cta" id="how-it-works"><div><span className="public-kicker">START WITH A CLEAN WORKSPACE</span><h2>Set up your business with one source of truth.</h2><p>The first account is the platform Super Admin. Business owners apply only through secure registration links issued by the Super Admin.</p></div><a className="primary" href="#capabilities">Explore capabilities <span>→</span></a></section>
